  "description": "A humorous or self-deprecating reference to a post that the creator considers trivial, uninteresting, or poorly conceived. The phrase 'stupid post' is used to set up the expectation that the content to follow will be of low quality or not worth the viewer's time, creating a comedic contrast with the dramatic audience reaction in the image.",
